 you deeper into the city, and into yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234100/extras/5f012405685af574333dd85bb2897269.poster.avif?t=1755003841\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234100/extras/5f012405685af574333dd85bb2897269.webm?t=1755003841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Trade and Stories</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between intense looting runs, find respite at your shop where fellow survivors gather to trade. By selling items they desperately need, you'll not only earn more scrap but also uncover their haunting survival stories. Each completed trade reveals another chapter of their journey, making every transaction meaningful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234100/extras/82d3e44502d9f2c0abad4237b846ed06.poster.avif?t=1755003841\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234100/extras/82d3e44502d9f2c0abad4237b846ed06.webm?t=1755003841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense 20-30 Minute Survival Runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced Zombie AI with Dynamic Horde Behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-Crafted Pixel Art Environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Environment with Strategic Traps and Defensive Turrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory Management System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mergeable Items </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expandable Backpack System with Specialized Types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base Building &amp; Trading System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich Survivor Stories to Uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Unique Playable Characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike Progression System  </p></li></ul>",
